WEBVTT

00:36:24.816 --> 00:36:30.260
I'm willing to be in all of it,
at the same time, often.

00:36:30.284 --> 00:36:32.291
CA: Tell me a bit more about Rayya.

00:36:32.315 --> 00:36:34.375
EG: Oh my God.

00:36:34.399 --> 00:36:35.915
Rayya was everything.

00:36:35.939 --> 00:36:41.025
Rayya was the biggest person
I ever met in my entire life.

00:36:41.049 --> 00:36:43.155
She was so epic.

00:36:43.179 --> 00:36:44.919
She was a Syrian immigrant.

00:36:44.943 --> 00:36:48.198
She came to this country
when she was 10 years old.

00:36:48.222 --> 00:36:49.432
And she was a musician,

00:36:49.456 --> 00:36:53.261
she was kind of a rock star in the '80s
on the Lower East Side in New York City.

00:36:53.285 --> 00:36:55.349
She was a hairdresser, she was an artist,

00:36:55.373 --> 00:36:57.020
and she was an addict.

00:36:57.044 --> 00:37:00.698
She spent 17 years
as a speedball heroin junkie